<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>بافاريا موتورز | عالم BMW</title>
  <meta name="description" content="معرض بافاريا موتورز لعرض سيارات BMW الحديثة: الفئة 3 و5 و7 وX وM والكهربائية.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@300;400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #070d17;
      --bg-2: #0b1424;
      --card: #0e1828;
      --gold: #d4af6a;
      --gold-2: #f2d890;
      --text: #f3efe6;
      --muted: #8b93a3;
      --border: rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.18);
      --radius: 18px;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

    .container { width: min(1200px, 92%); margin: 0 auto; }

    /* ========== Header ========== */
    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(7, 13, 23, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav {
      height: 80px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .logo-text h1 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.2; }
    .logo-text span { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 1px; }

    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #d9d6cf;
      transition: color .3s;
      position: relative;
    }
    .nav-links a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -6px; right: 0;
      width: 0; height: 2px;
      background: var(--gold);
      transition: width .3s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-2); }
    .nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

    .btn-gold {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-2));
      color: #1a1408;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.25);
      transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn-gold:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.35); }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 13px 28px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: border-color .3s, color .3s;
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold-2); }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* ========== Hero ========== */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 140px 0 80px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 25% 40%, rgba(30, 70, 120, 0.35), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.08), transparent 45%),
        var(--bg);
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.12) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 26px 26px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, black 10%, transparent 70%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, black 10%, transparent 70%);
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .badge::before {
      content: '';
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      background: var(--gold);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--gold);
    }
    .hero h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.6rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .hero h2 span {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-2), var(--gold));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }
    .hero p {
      color: #b5bcc9;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .hero-buttons { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .hero-tags { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .hero-tags span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
      height: 460px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .ring {
      position: absolute;
      width: 400px; height: 400px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.3);
      animation: spin 40s linear infinite;
    }
    .ring::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: -6px;
      width: 12px; height: 12px;
      background: var(--gold);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--gold);
    }
    .ring.inner { width: 300px; height: 300px; animation-duration: 25s; animation-direction: reverse; }
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

    .hero-car {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 30px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
      animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    @keyframes float { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-14px); } }

    .float-card {
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(14, 24, 40, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      z-index: 3;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }
    .float-card small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; display: block; }
    .float-card strong { color: var(--text); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; }
    .fc-1 { top: 10%; right: 0; animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .fc-2 { bottom: 8%; left: 0; animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite reverse; }

    /* ========== Sections ========== */
    section { padding: 110px 0; position: relative; }
    .section-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; }
    .section-tag { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .section-head h3 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800; margin-top: 8px; }
    .section-head p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 620px; margin: 14px auto 0; }

    /* ========== Filters & Search ========== */
    .toolbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .filters { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .filter-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 9px 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all .3s;
    }
    .filter-btn:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .filter-btn.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-2));
      color: #1a1408;
      border-color: transparent;
    }
    .search-box {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-width: 260px;
    }
    .search-box input {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .search-box input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); }

    /* ========== Cars Grid ========== */
    .cars-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(290px, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .car-card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--card), var(--bg-2));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 26px;
      transition: transform .4s, border-color .4s, box-shadow .4s;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .car-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .car-card .series {
      position: absolute;
      top: 18px; left: 18px;
      background: rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.12);
      color: var(--gold);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .car-img {
      height: 170px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .car-img svg { width: 85%; height: auto; transition: transform .5s; }
    .car-card:hover .car-img svg { transform: scale(1.05); }
    .car-card h4 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; }
    .car-card .desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 6px 0 16px; min-height: 48px; }
    .car-specs {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 16px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #b5bcc9;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .car-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .price { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold-2); }
    .price small { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; display: block; }
    .details-btn {
      background: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      color: var(--gold);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: all .3s;
    }
    .details-btn:hover { background: var(--gold); color: #1a1408; }
    .no-results { grid-column: 1 / -1; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); padding: 40px; }

    /* ========== Features ========== */
    .features { background: var(--bg-2); }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 26px;
    }
    .feature {
      padding: 36px 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--card);
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform .3s;
    }
    .feature:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); }
    .feature .icon {
      width: 64px; height: 64px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.1);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }
    .feature h5 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }

    /* ========== About / Stats ========== */
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 26px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .stat { text-align: center; padding: 30px; border-top: 2px solid var(--gold); background: var(--card); border-radius: var(--radius); }
    .stat strong { display: block; font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold-2); }
    .stat span { color: var(--muted); }

    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
    .about-text h3 { font-size: 2.3rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .about-text p { color: #b5bcc9; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .about-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 40px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(30, 70, 120, 0.3), var(--card));
      text-align: center;
    }
    .about-box .big-car svg { width: 100%; }

    /* ========== Contact ========== */
    .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 50px; }
    .contact-info .item {
      display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    .contact-info .item .ic {
      width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(212, 175, 106, 0.1);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .contact-info small { color: var(--muted); display: block; }
    form {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 38px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    form .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color .3s;
    }
    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { border-color: var(--gold); }
    select option { background: var(--card); }
    textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
    .form-msg { color: var(--gold-2); font-weight: 600; text-align: center; display: none; }

    /* ========== Footer ========== */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 50px 0 30px;
      background: var(--bg-2);
    }
    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .footer-grid h6 { color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .footer-grid ul { list-style: none; }
    .footer-grid li { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--muted); }
    .footer-grid li a:hover { color: var(--gold-2); }
    .copy { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 24px; }

    /* ========== Modal ========== */
    .modal {
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 200;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .modal.open { display: flex; }
    .modal-content {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      max-width: 760px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px;
      position: relative;
      animation: pop .35s ease;
    }
    @keyframes pop { from { transform: scale(.92); opacity: 0; } to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }
    .modal-close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 18px; left: 18px;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .modal-close:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .modal h3 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 900; }
    .modal .modal-desc { color: var(--muted); margin: 8px 0 24px; }
    .modal .modal-car { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .modal-specs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .modal-specs div {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .modal-specs small { color: var(--muted); display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    .modal-specs strong { color: var(--text); font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .modal-actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* ========== Reveal Animation ========== */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity .8s ease, transform .8s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    /* ========== Responsive ========== */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero-grid, .about-grid, .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-visual { height: 380px; }
      .ring { width: 320px; height: 320px; }
      .ring.inner { width: 240px; height: 240px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links {
        position: fixed;
        top: 80px; right: 0; left: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 30px 0;
        gap: 24px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        transform: translateY(-150%);
        transition: transform .4s;
        z-index: -1;
      }
      .nav-links.open { transform: translateY(0); }
      .menu-toggle { display: block; }
      .nav-cta { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      form .row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .modal-specs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .float-card { display: none; }
      .search-box { min-width: 100%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Gradient definitions for car SVGs -->
  <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="carGold" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f2d890"/>
        <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#d4af6a"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8a6a33"/>
      </linearGradient>
      <linearGradient id="carBlue" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#5b8fd0"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1c3f6e"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
  </svg>

  <!-- ========== Header ========== -->
  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#home" class="logo">
        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
          <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" stroke="#d4af6a" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="16" fill="url(#carGold)" opacity=".15"/>
          <path d="M24 8 L36 15 L36 33 L24 40 L12 33 L12 15 Z" stroke="#d4af6a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
          <path d="M24 8 V40 M12 15 L36 33 M36 15 L12 33" stroke="#f2d890" stroke-width=".8" opacity=".6"/>
          <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="4" fill="#f2d890"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="logo-text">
          <h1>بافاريا موتورز</h1>
          <span>معرض فئة BMW</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="#home">الرئيسية</a></li>
        <li><a href="#cars">السيارات</a></li>
        <li><a href="#features">المميزات</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">عن المعرض</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">تواصل معنا</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold nav-cta">احجز الآن</a>
        <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="القائمة">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ========== Hero ========== -->
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <div class="badge">معرض معتمد · أحدث الإصدارات</div>
        <h2>عالم BMW <span>للقيادة الحقيقية.</span></h2>
        <p>
          اكتشف مجموعة مختارة من سيارات BMW الجديدة، من الفئة الاقتصادية الأنيقة إلى
          الأداء الرياضي لسيارات M والكهرباء الكاملة مع iX وi4.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#cars" class="btn-gold">استكشف السيارات ←</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline">احجز تجربة قيادة</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span>✓ ضمان شامل</span>
          <span>✓ تمويل مرن</span>
          <span>✓ صيانة معتمدة</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="ring"></div>
        <div class="ring inner"></div>

        <svg class="hero-car" viewBox="0 0 400 180" fill="none">
          <ellipse cx="200" cy="165" rx="170" ry="10" fill="#000" opacity=".5"/>
          <path d="M40 120 L60 92 Q80 62 130 56 L260 52 Q310 56 335 90 L365 104 Q380 110 378 124 L376 132 L40 132 Z" fill="url(#carGold)"/>
          <path d="M110 60 Q130 42 170 40 L250 40 Q290 42 305 62 Z" fill="#0b1424" opacity=".85"/>
